Description: Keep unassigned Wayland surfaces off the desktop scene
 A client may upload a cursor image before it has pointer focus. Its surface
 must not be drawn at the compositor's fallback window position while waiting
 for a valid set_cursor request. Role owners already attach surfaces to their
 appropriate scene containers. Exercise rendering, input, rejected requests,
 cursor movement, hiding and recommitting through a real Wayland connection.
Author: yeyebbc <19569343+yeyebbc@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-23

